paragraph('packages/domain/src/README.md','- `advanceWorld(world, seconds)`:', '- `advanceWorld(world, seconds, { maxIntervals })`: advances a bounded prefix of elapsed game time without AI. The caller subtracts actual `simTime` progress, not calls or requested seconds. Paused/navigation-blocked worlds do not advance. Due start transitions, captured rates, endpoint effects and sampled perception follow [simulation time](../../../docs/simulation-time.md); host presence, speed and budgets remain application responsibilities.')
